1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,989
When the string makes an angle theta with the vertical, split the weight m g in two.

2
00:00:05,989 --> 00:00:11,080
Along the string, m g cos theta, which the tension balances.

3
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:14,166
Across it, m g sine theta.

4
00:00:14,166 --> 00:00:17,057
That component has nothing to balance it.

5
00:00:17,057 --> 00:00:22,109
It is the restoring force, always pulling the bob back towards the lowest point.

